cond president of the Democratic Republic of the Congo, from 1965 to 1971.\nMobutu served as the fifth chairperson of the Organisation of African Unity from 1967 to 1968. During the Congo Crisis in 1960, Mobutu, then serving as Chief of Staff of the Congolese Army, deposed the nation's democratically elected government of Patrice Lumumba with the support of the U.S. and Belgium.","image":"Mobutu.jpg","birth":1930.7835616438356,"death":1997.682191780822}},"media":{"Flag of Zaire (1971–1997).svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Flag_of_Zaire_%281971%E2%80%931997%29.svg/330px-Flag_of_Zaire_%281971%E2%80%931997%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Zaire_(1971%E2%80%931997).svg","author":"User:Moyogo","license":"Public domain"},"Coat of arms of Zaire (1971–1997).svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Coat_of_arms_of_Zaire_%281971%E2%80%931997%29.svg/330px-Coat_of_arms_of_Zaire_%281971%E2%80%931997%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coat_of_arms_of_Zaire_(1971%E2%80%931997).svg","author":"Tadpole9, Д.Ильин","license":"Public domain"},"Mobutu.jpg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Mobutu.jpg/330px-Mobutu.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mobutu.jpg","author":"Frank Hall","license":"Public domain"}},"names":["Republic of Zaire","República do Zaire","République du Zaïre","Zair","Zaire","Zairum","Zaïre","Ζαΐρ","Заир","Республика Заир","زئیر","زائير","ザイール","扎伊尔","扎伊尔共和国","扎伊爾共和國","薩伊","薩伊共和國"]}